config BR2_PACKAGE_SOF_FIRMWARE
	bool "sof-firmware (Sound Open Firmware for Intel audio DSPs)"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  The firmware and topologies for the audio DSP in Intel laptops
	  from Cannon Lake (2018) to Panther Lake and beyond, as the SOF
	  project releases them in sof-bin: the IPC3 firmware and
	  topologies for the older parts, the IPC4 ones for Meteor Lake
	  on. Without these the kernel's SOF driver loads, finds no
	  firmware, and the machine has no sound at all.

	  Intel's signed firmware is under Intel's binary licence; the
	  topologies and the community builds are BSD-3-Clause.

	  https://github.com/thesofproject/sof-bin
